  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hong Chi Ming recounts that Late Antiquity Era’s Three Thatch Demon Immortal created Thatched Hut and spent almost all of his wealth on it. During his later years he roamed Northern Plains and became a grand overlord for a while. He had a daughter he doted on. Dong Fang tribe’s Gu Immortal Dong Fang Yu loved that woman, left the righteous path for the demonic path, and after Three Thatch Demon Immortal died inherited Thatched Hut, killed his wife, returned to the righteous path and his tribe, then added Gu and renamed the house Modest Thatched Hut for reputation without changing its effect.",
